diff --git a/debian/changelog b/debian/changelog
index 8c3f50a..6cd8b72 100644
--- a/debian/changelog
+++ b/debian/changelog
@@ -1,3 +1,15 @@
+netcfg (1.206+deb13vlan1) trixie; urgency=medium
+
+  * Rebuild the VLAN-capable netcfg against Debian 13 dependencies.
+  * Allow custom automated entries to request the optional VLAN question at
+    high priority without changing standard installer behavior.
+  * Validate the complete VLAN ID, show a defined error, and fetch the updated
+    value after invalid input is reprompted.
+  * Avoid writing a duplicate ifupdown stanza for the VLAN parent interface.
+  * Add unit tests for VLAN ID parsing.
+
+ -- Andrew J. Moore <andrew@forevermoore.net>  Sun, 09 Nov 2026 08:30:00 -0500
+
 netcfg (1.206) unstable; urgency=medium
 
   * Team upload.
